### REST Client — S6.6 Azure Key Vault. API local. Todo offline.

@host = http://localhost:5093

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### ¿Dónde va esto y con qué rol mínimo? (slide 2-5)
GET {{host}}/kv/donde?que=ConexionAzureAAzure&acceso=Lectura
###
GET {{host}}/kv/donde?que=ApiKeyExterna&acceso=Lectura
###
GET {{host}}/kv/donde?que=CertificadoSsl&acceso=Gestion

### Construir Key Vault Reference (slide 6)
GET {{host}}/kv/referencia?vault=kv-ventas-prod&secret=StripeApiKey

### Parsear Key Vault Reference (slide 6)
POST {{host}}/kv/referencia/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{ "valor": "@Microsoft.KeyVault(VaultName=kv-ventas-prod;SecretName=StripeApiKey)" }

### ¿Toca rotar el secreto? (slide 8-9)
POST {{host}}/kv/rotacion
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expira": "2026-06-10T00:00:00Z", "ahora": "2026-05-19T00:00:00Z", "ventanaDias": 30 }

### Plan de almacenamiento completo (slide 2-6)
POST {{host}}/kv/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "que": "ApiKeyExterna", "acceso": "Lectura", "vaultName": "kv-ventas-prod", "itemName": "StripeApiKey" }
